<div class="w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  <div class="mb-6">
    <%= link_to "← Back to recipes", recipes_path, class: "text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700" %>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 text-center">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <div class="animate-spin rounded-full h-16 w-16 border-b-2 border-emerald-600 mx-auto mb-4"></div>
      <h1 class="font-bold text-2xl mb-4">Processing Your Recipe</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
        We're using OCR to extract text from your recipe images. This may take a moment depending on the number of images and their complexity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2">📸 What's happening:</h3>
      <ul class="text-sm text-blue-700 space-y-1 text-left">
        <li>• Analyzing images with advanced OCR technology</li>
        <li>• Extracting ingredients and instructions</li>
        <li>• Combining results from multiple pages</li>
        <li>• Preparing your recipe for editing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
      <p>This page will automatically redirect when processing is complete.</p>
      <p>If it doesn't redirect after 2-3 minutes, you can refresh this page.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-center space-x-4">
      <%= link_to "Check Status", scan_status_recipes_path(scan_key: params[:scan_key]), 
          class: "bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Cancel", recipes_path, 
          class: "bg-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded-lg" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // Auto-refresh every 5 seconds
  setTimeout(function() {
    window.location.reload();
  }, 5000);
</script>
